Z||000002||bigpacupacu||09-12-2001||07:09 PM||||I went to see the naw movie RAT RACE this weekend and there was this part when Whoopie Goldberg was asking directions from the "squirrel Lady", and got bogus directions (becase she didn't buy a squirrel) and ended up driving down a steep hill and landed in a pile of junked cars,( other people who didn't buy a squirrel!)<BR>Anyway there was a red fiero with a luggage rack in the pile! Not a glamorous sight being trashed liked that.<BR> Did anybody else see it?<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.spotlife.com/users2/bigpacupacu/webalbum/pic/image009.jpg">  <BR>Steven<BR>85GT 4sp||||reg||1
