Z||000004||Springtyme||09-13-2001||08:26 AM||||Okay, so this isn't exactly a TV sighting, but I was at Wendys last night going through the drive through, then I had to circle back around to get out of the parking lot, and I had to stop cause a car was coming in. I'm sitting there and I see a car with the pop up headlights coming in. I'm thinking "Ford Probe" until it goes by and I was like "THAT WAS A FIERO!!!" so I go back around AGAIN and pull up next to them (it was a black coupe, I think 85... not sure though) and I called out my window "I like your car!" and the lady and her passenger laughed and waved! I was so excited about it last night I could barely sleep =)<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Springtyme.jpg"> <P>            ~Springtyme~||||reg||10
